.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-attestation-generate 1  "oct-attestation-generate " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-attestation\-generate \- Generate attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct attestation generate\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> <\fB\-k\fR|\fB\-\-key\fR> [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-user\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.PP
An attestation statement can only be generated for key slots that contain keys that were generated by the card. See \*(Aqoct admin generate\*(Aq and \*(Aqoct status \-v\*(Aq.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-k\fR, \fB\-\-key\fR \fI<Key slot>\fR
Key slot to use
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
SIG
.IP \(bu 2
DEC
.IP \(bu 2
AUT
.RE
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-user\-pin\fR \fI<User PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get User PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
